    "name": "Génération Mawazine",
    "id": "generation-mawazine",
    "description": "National music competition run by the Maroc-Cultures association (the organizers of Mawazine) to discover young Moroccan talent in rap, hip-hop, electro and fusion. Open to musicians aged 13-33, it holds auditions across several cities (Rabat, Casablanca, Fès, Marrakech) from January to April, with semifinals and finals in Rabat. Documented editions run from 2006 to 2013.",
